"Gratis en betaalde meditaties die je in je eigen tempo kunt beluisteren."
msgstr "Free and paid meditations you can listen to at your own pace."

#: inc/placeholder-content.php
msgid "Praten over wat er bij je speelt"
msgstr "Talking about what is going on for you"

#: inc/placeholder-content.php
msgid "Hulp"
msgstr "Help"

#: inc/placeholder-content.php
